---
import config from "../../data/config.json";
import EditionCrafter from "@cu-mkp/editioncrafter";
import { getUrl } from "../util/path";
---

<html>
  <head>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href=`${getUrl('ec_logo.svg')}` />
    <title>De la source à la danse</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..40,100..1000;1,9..40,100..1000&family=Martel:wght@200;300;400;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  </head>
  <body>
    <!-- Top Nav Bar -->
    <div class="top-nav">
      <div class="top-nav-container">
        <a class="nav-logo" href="https://editioncrafter.org">
          <img src=`${getUrl('ec_logo.svg')}` alt="EditionCrafter" width="134" height="74" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
          <p class="nav-logo-text font-serif">Edition Crafter</p>
        </a>
        <div class="nav-links">
          <a href="https://github.com/cathydeplee/domenico" style="text-decoration: none;">
            <button class="github-button">
              View on GitHub &rarr;
            </button>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Header Box -->
    <div class="bg-neutral">
      <div class="header-container">
        <div>
          <h1 class="font-serif project-title">De la source à la danse</h1>
          <h2 class="project-subtitle">Domenico da Piacenza's dance treatise edition and reenactment project</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Project Description Box -->
    <div class="bg-white">
      <div class="description-container">
        <p class="leading-loose font-light project-desc-text">
          Ce projet propose une édition numérique ouverte et vivante du premier traité de danse occidental (Bnf ms. ital 972, c. 1455) dû à Domenico da Piacenza ainsi que sa traduction française. Ce travail actuellement <i>in progress</i> offrira, dans sa phase finale, la possibilité de lire facilement et de visualiser, grâce à des vidéo, cette source majeure de la danse dite savante. Il est le fruit de plusieurs années de recherche collective soutenu par l'Université Côte d'Azur.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <EditionCrafter {...config} client:only="react" />
  </body>
</html>
<style>
  body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: "DM Sans", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
    color: #1a202c;
  }
  .bg-neutral {
    background-color: rgb(249, 244, 239);
    width: 100%;
  }
  .bg-white {
    background-color: #ffffff;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .font-serif {
    font-family: "Martel", ui-serif, Georgia, Cambria, "Times New Roman", Times, serif;
  }
  .font-light {
    font-weight: 300;
  }
  .leading-loose {
    line-height: 2;
  }

  /* Top Nav Styling */
  .top-nav {
    width: 100%;
    background-color: #ffffff;
  }
  .top-nav-container {
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    max-width: 1280px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .top-nav-container { padding: 2rem 4rem; }
  }
  @media (min-width: 1280px) {
    .top-nav-container { padding: 2rem 6rem; }
  }
  .nav-logo {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
  }
  .nav-logo-text {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 7rem;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .nav-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .github-button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    background-color: #1a202c;
    color: #ffffff;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  .github-button:hover {
    background-color: #4a5568;
  }

  /* Header Box Styling */
  .header-container {
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
    max-width: 1280px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: center;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .header-container { padding: 0 4rem; }
  }
  @media (min-width: 1280px) {
    .header-container { padding: 0 6rem; }
  }
  .project-title {
    font-size: 3rem;
    padding: 4rem 0 0.5rem 0;
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: normal;
  }
  .project-subtitle {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin: 0 0 4rem 0;
    color: #4a5568;
  }

  /* Description Box Styling */
  .description-container {
    padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
    max-width: 1280px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .description-container { padding: 3rem 4rem; }
  }
  @media (min-width: 1280px) {
    .description-container { padding: 3rem 6rem; }
  }
  .project-desc-text {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
</style>
